        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-11T13:33:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "change to report failure and retry unfinished request if already enabled. Just ignore request if risky because there is no guarantee that request would always successful.\nnew request -\u003e Tethering#setXXXTethering -\u003e downstream service(e.g. from WifiManager, Usbmanager, ...). There is no callback mechanism in each downstream service to report starting fail.",
      "parentUuid": "a6a0b30d_a8b03a5e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 498,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 498,
        "endChar": 13
