        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-12T08:47:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We just had a long talk with Lorenzo about what to do here, it\u0027s a tough problem.\nWe went through what would happen if you stop/start tethering immediately, and it *seems* like the code would handle that fine.\n\nSo our idea is: if tethering is already started, and the request is different, stop tethering and restart it immediately after with the new parameters.",
      "parentUuid": "8b518e5d_90ddd569",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 498,
        "startChar": 12,
